                "text": "The GOP cut the ACA, and Medicaid, and Medicare by more than $1 Trillion to give tax breaks to Billionaires causing insurance rates to skyrocket to a 15 year high. Now on top of that, @HouseAppropsGOP are trying to cut vital health funds even deeper. Is there no shame?!?! https://t.co/GkMVu88yBm",
