                "text": "Standing up for working families, seniors, and small businesses by protecting access to affordable healthcare, and vital programs including Medicare and Medicaid. Those who would gut them will cause millions of Americans to lose coverage. We must reverse cruel GOP cuts to care. https://t.co/uveSOyWMJr",
