                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our government will shut down at midnight. Where are Republicans? On vacation\u2014forcing a government shut down. While they sit at home and ignore millions of their constituents in need, House Democrats are here in DC defending our communities and their access to healthcare. We are not the same.",
