                "text": "Rural Ohio families are paying the price for federal policy chaos. The shutdown threatens farmers\u2019 livelihoods and rural hospitals, all to raise health insurance costs by nearly 90%. Our communities need stability, not games with people\u2019s health and tariffs making it even worse. https://t.co/gzi2YGYW6j",
